/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1493]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Cardiac Rarely</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1494]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Sensory neural deafness</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1495]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>Clinical presentation:</strong></em></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1496]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>P</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><sup>0</sup></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>amenorrhea</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> 70 \u2013 80% </span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1497]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Cyclical abd pain \u2013 if functional endometrium in uterine </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>bud</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>, needs to be removed</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1498]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Dyspareunia</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> </span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1499]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Subfertility</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1500]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>On Examination:</strong></em></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1501]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>N</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>ormal</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> ssc</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1502]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Ovaries \u2013 present </span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1503]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Uterus \u2013 absent</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1504]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Vagina \u2013 blind </span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1505]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>Diagnostic tests:</strong></em></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1506]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>2D USG \u2013 initial </span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1507]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>3D USG </span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1508]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>MRI \u2013 Gold standard</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1509]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>IUV</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1510]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Karyotyping to exclude CA</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>IS</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> </span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1511]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>X ray spine + limbs</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1512]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Echocardiogram</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1513]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>D/D</strong></em></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1514]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>CAIS</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1515]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Imperforate Hymen.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1516]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>MANAGEMENT:</strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1517]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>Psychological support:</strong></em></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1518]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>Fertility:</strong></em></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1519]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Surrogacy (partial surrogacy) - egg retrieval via abdominal route</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1520]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1521]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>Adoption</strong></em></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1522]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>Uterine transplant</strong></em></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1523]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>Creation of neo-vagina \u2013 </strong></em></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em>timing depend on sexual activity.</em></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1524]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", san